<title>CHINA: China Jan-June beef exports down 27.3 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-June beef exports down 27.3 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>China exported 10,000 tonnes of beef in January-June, down 27.3 percent from the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Friday.</p>
<p>	EXPORT JAN-JUNE   JUNE	  YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p> Beef     10,000	   0		 -27.3</p>
<p>Note: Figures in tonnes</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
